# Cashew Curry Beef with Rice Noodles

Based on [https://recipecenter.giantfood.com/recipes/…](https://recipecenter.giantfood.com/recipes/236572/instant-pot-cashew-curry-beef-with-rice-noodles) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20220926102751/https://recipecenter.giantfood.com/recipes/236572/instant-pot-cashew-curry-beef-with-rice-noodles))

{ rating="4" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 Tbsp [canola oil]{ ing="canola-oil" }
- [ ] 1 1/2 lbs [cubed beef stew meat]{ ing="cubed-beef-stew-meat" }
- [ ] 1 [onion]{ ing="onion" }, finely chopped
- [ ] 3 Tbsp [curry powder]{ ing="curry-powder" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [cayenne powder]{ ing="cayenne-powder" } (optional)
- [ ] 2 1/2 cups [reduced-sodium beef broth]{ ing="reduced-sodium-beef-broth" }
- [ ] 4 small [red potatoes]{ ing="red-potatoes" }, scrubbed and quartered
- [ ] 1 (13.5 oz) can [lite unsweetened coconut milk]{ ing="lite-unsweetened-coconut-milk" }
- [ ] 1 (10 oz) bag Nature’s Promise [Organic Green Beans]{ ing="organic-green-beans" }
- [ ] 4 oz [thin rice noodles]{ ing="thin-rice-noodles" } (note: typically sold in 8 or 16 oz containers)
- [ ] 1/3 cup [cashews]{ ing="cashews" }
- [ ] 1/2 [chopped cilantro]{ ing="chopped-cilantro" }

## Recipe

1. In an Instant Pot®, heat the [oil]{ ing="canola-oil" } on the sauté function on high. Season the beef with salt and pepper. Working in batches, sear beef 4–6 min., until browned on all sides. Turn off Instant Pot® and remove beef with a slotted spoon. Set aside.
1. To pot, add the [onion]{ ing="onion" }. Stir in the [curry powder]{ ing="curry-powder" } and cayenne, if using. Season with salt and pepper. Set to sauté function again and add 1/2 cup water to deglaze, scraping up brown bits with a wooden spoon. Cook 5 min., until onion is tender. Stir in the [broth]{ ing="reduced-sodium-beef-broth" } and seared beef. Seal lid and set to high pressure. Cook 15 min., then quick release.
1. To pot, add the [potatoes]{ ing="red-potatoes" }. Seal lid and set to high pressure. Cook 3 min., then quick release. Stir in the [coconut milk]{ ing="lite-unsweetened-coconut-milk" } and season with salt and pepper. Set Instant Pot® to sauté function. Add the [green beans]{ ing="organic-green-beans" } and [rice noodles]{ ing="thin-rice-noodles" } and cook 4–5 min., until softened. Top with the [cashews]{ ing="cashews" } and [cilantro]{ ing="chopped-cilantro" } just before serving.

## Notes

### Recipe Philosophy

- **Practical curry powder approach:** Uses 3 Tbsp curry powder instead of individual spices for weeknight convenience while building complexity through browning beef and deglazing
- **Layered flavor:** Searing beef + deglazing fond + curry powder + coconut milk creates restaurant-quality depth without tempering or specialty ingredients
